# Casdoor 4.x seed for built-in/admin's first-start password. 3.x hardcoded
# "123"; 4.x leaves it empty for the /init-admin welcome page unless
# initAdminPassword is set (getInitAdminPassword, object/init.go), which would
# break both fresh-install consumers that still assume the factory password:
# casdoor-sso-controller's bootstrap (CASDOOR_ADMIN_PASSWORD) and
# marketplace-ui's onboarding (CASDOOR_ADMIN_DEFAULT_PASSWORD). Seeded here via
# the chart's existingSecret mechanism (values.yaml marks the inline `value`
# "for local tests only"); create-only at source, so an initialized cluster's
# onboarding-set password (openbao system/admin) is never touched.
# This is the platform's documented factory credential, not a secret — the same
# committed-machine-credential pattern as apps/gogs (docs/DECISIONS_LOG.md
# row 7). Keep the three copies equal; the per-cluster secret-backed promotion
# is #392.
initAdminPassword=123
